        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bb9b4979-e40f-568c-90e7-c808eaecb462",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Kournikova, Jana Novotná, Natasha Zvereva, Martina Hingis, Lindsay Davenport, Mary Pierce, Serena Williams, Venus Williams\n- Events: 1999 French Open – Women's Doubles\n- Topics: professional tennis\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Sergeyevna Kournikova was born on 7 June 1981 and is a Russian former professional tennis player.\n- At the 1999 French Open women’s doubles event, Jana Novotná partnered with Natasha Zvereva as the first seed.\n- At the 1999 French Open women’s doubles event, Martina Hingis partnered with Anna Kournikova as the second seed.\n- At the 1999 French Open women’s doubles event, Jana Novotná and Natasha Zvereva retired in their quarterfinal match against Lindsay Davenport and Mary Pierce.\n- At the 1999 French Open women’s doubles event, Martina Hingis and Anna Kournikova reached the final.\n- At the 1999 French Open women’s doubles event, Serena Williams and Venus Williams defeated Martina Hingis and Anna Kournikova in the final 6–3, 6–7, 8–6.",
